// FUNCTION: BFME2 0x004C26D0 size=430 name=?doSpecialPowerAtObject@CashHackSpecialPower@@UAEXPAVObject@@I@Z evidence=N:ledger
void CashHackSpecialPower::doSpecialPowerAtObject(Object *victim,unsigned int options)
{
    if(getObject()->isDisabled() || !victim) return;
    SpecialPowerModule::doSpecialPowerAtObject(victim,options);
    Object *self=getObject();
    Money *targetMoney=victim->getControllingPlayer()->getMoney();
    Money *ownMoney=self->getControllingPlayer()->getMoney();
    if(targetMoney && ownMoney) {
        unsigned int cash=targetMoney->countMoney();
        unsigned int amount=findAmountToSteal();
        cash=_STL::min(cash,amount);
        if(cash>0) {
            targetMoney->withdraw(cash,victim->getControllingPlayer()->getScoreKeeper(),true);
            ownMoney->deposit(cash,self->getControllingPlayer()->getScoreKeeper(),true);
            UnicodeString text;
            text.format(TheGameText->fetchPtr("GUI:AddCash",0),cash);
            Coord3D pos;
            pos.set(self->getPosition());
            pos.z+=20.0f;
            TheInGameUI->addFloatingText(text,&pos,0xff00ff00);
            text.format(TheGameText->fetchPtr("GUI:LoseCash",0),cash);
            pos.set(victim->getPosition());
            pos.z+=30.0f;
            TheInGameUI->addFloatingText(text,&pos,0xffff0000);
        }
    }
}

